 "faq": [
  {
   "q": "Is the cyclone coming to Hyderabad?",
   "a": "No. Hyderabad has no cyclone alert. Expect clouds, light to moderate rain and gusty winds. The heavy-rain alert is for Khammam, Kothagudem, Mulugu and Mahabubabad."
  },
  {
   "q": "Is the danger over on the coast?",
   "a": "The strongest winds are over: the storm is on land and weakening. Flash floods and fallen lines are still a risk today. Stay indoors until officials say it's safe."
  },
  {
   "q": "Are schools closed?",
   "a": "AP closed schools Oct 27–28 in 13 coastal districts (Anakapalli till Oct 29). Check your district's order for Oct 29."
  },
  {
   "q": "Are trains and flights running?",
   "a": "53–91 trains and 21+ flights (Vijayawada, Visakhapatnam) were cancelled. Check IRCTC / your airline before leaving."
  },
  {
   "q": "When will power come back?",
   "a": "No restoration time announced yet. Report fallen lines or outages in coastal AP on 1912 (APEPDCL)."
  },
  {
   "q": "My family is in a red district. How do I check on them?",
   "a": "Call the district control room listed for their district. In AP you can also WhatsApp Mana Mitra on 9552300009 (send 'Hi')."
  }
